meta {
  name: 05_ResourceFilter
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Scenario: The resource filter narrows the list to parties where the subject holds the resource

    When a service owner lists a subject filtered on a resource the subject holds on one client
    Then that client is returned carrying only the filtered resource, and clients reached
    without that resource drop out
    When the subject is one that does not hold that resource
    Then the client that carries it for someone else is not returned
}
